<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>Object to set the variable on<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sVarName<dd>The name of the object variable to set<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oValue<dd>The value of the object variable
